  "description_short": "Hartenbos coffee shop serving quality brews, light meals, and sweet treats in a relaxed neighbourhood setting.",
  "description_long": "Koffi Shoppi brings a welcome dose of caffeine culture to Hartenbos, just off Majuba Avenue. This friendly neighbourhood coffee shop has become a local favourite for its consistently good coffee, freshly baked goods, and laid-back atmosphere that invites you to linger a little longer.\n\nThe menu covers all the essentials — proper espresso-based drinks, light breakfast options, sandwiches, and a tempting display of cakes and pastries. It's the kind of place where you can grab a quick takeaway on your way to the beach or settle in with a cappuccino and a good book. The relaxed vibe and welcoming staff make it feel more like visiting a friend's kitchen than just another coffee stop.\n\nConveniently located in the heart of Hartenbos, Koffi Shoppi serves the local community and holidaymakers alike. Whether you're after your morning fix, a mid-afternoon pick-me-up, or something sweet to round off a beach day, this unpretentious spot delivers without fuss.",
